{"id":"03527aba4c537723","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-type.md","title":"Type","display":"df-type — Type","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-type","aliases":["93-df-type"],"display":"df-type — Type","depends_on":["[[93-df-first-order-formula]]","[[93-df-first-order-theory]]","[[93-df-first-order-satisfaction]]","[[93-df-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-type"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-type</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-type — Type"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"84c35fea1e867240\" href=\"?note=84c35fea1e867240\" title=\"93-df-first-order-formula\">93-df-first-order-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"30a8f872911e731f\" href=\"?note=30a8f872911e731f\" title=\"93-df-first-order-theory\">93-df-first-order-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"56c1f813209c75e1\" href=\"?note=56c1f813209c75e1\" title=\"93-df-first-order-satisfaction\">93-df-first-order-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" href=\"?note=2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" title=\"93-df-model\">93-df-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-theory and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\">\\(\\bar x\\)</span> is an injective finite tuple of variables; its length is bound inside the definition.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> is a set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-formulas whose free variables lie in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}\\)</span> have their sourced signatures; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fo}\">\\(\\mathrm{fo}\\)</span> is a mnemonic sort tag.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Type}_{93}\\)</span> is the semantically consistent partial-type predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}type}\\vdash\\mathrm{Type}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\land p\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;(\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;\\exists\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[\\bar a/\\bar x])\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}type}\\vdash\\mathrm{Type}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\land p\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;(\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;\\exists\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[\\bar a/\\bar x])\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Joint realizability in a model of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is the consistency condition; it does not reuse the unrelated propositional calculus predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"84c35fea1e867240","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-theory","status":"resolved","id":"30a8f872911e731f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"56c1f813209c75e1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"2e6273b8ebf2e31a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-model]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar x","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fo}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Type}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}type}\\vdash\\mathrm{Type}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FOTheory}_{93}(T;\\mathcal L)\\land p\\subseteq\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;(\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{fo}}_{93}(\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\bar x))\\\\\n&\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\exists\\mathfrak A\\;\\exists\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[\\bar a/\\bar x])\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}","display":false}],"bytes":1619,"backlinks":[{"id":"1fd6e0844d0c8dd1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61a9386f2a01b571","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Type}_{93}$ (type predicate, see [[93-df-type]])"},{"id":"840f3a795c44b39b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["84c35fea1e867240","30a8f872911e731f","56c1f813209c75e1","2e6273b8ebf2e31a"]}